{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 2930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1930, "text": "What's that, Harry?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 4830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2970, "text": "Another lecture for your night school\nclass?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 7090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5170, "text": "Bigger than that, Mac. This is the final\nexam."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 11490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7670, "text": "Ooh, the swan song for the Koch\ncommunity clodhoppers."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 15350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12410, "text": "So what's the hardest question besides\nname here?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 19610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17610, "text": "All right, Mr. Know -It -All, try this\none."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 22930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19870, "text": "Miss Douglas has been brought in on a\nshoplifting charge."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 25470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23190, "text": "What is the standard three -point\ndefense?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 28390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26030, "text": "Easy. Short skirt, plunging neckline,\nand no underwear."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 32239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31240, "text": "Hey, Christine."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 35400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32259, "text": "How was the ride on the old\ncongressional campaign trail?"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 39860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36160, "text": "Tiring. Besides fighting the darn cold,\nI was up all night working on the"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 41440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39860, "text": "opening jokes for my Women's League\nspeech."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 43660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42660, "text": "Jokes?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 44960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43960, "text": "You?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 48860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47860, "text": "What's wrong with that?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 53660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49800, "text": "Nothing. I just never thought of you as\nthe kind of girl who, you know, feels"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 56220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53660, "text": "comfortable saying funny things."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 59480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58480, "text": "That's ridiculous."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 62000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59900, "text": "I say lots of funny things, don't I,\nMac?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 66960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65960, "text": "Well?"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 69720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68440, "text": "Oh, yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 74120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69960, "text": "I remember a great joke you told about a\nstupid woman who wallpapered over her"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 75120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74120, "text": "cat."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 79300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76720, "text": "That stupid woman happened to be me."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 81900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80700, "text": "And it wasn't funny."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 84040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82540, "text": "I could have sworn I laughed."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 87240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86240, "text": "He must..."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 90630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88430, "text": "Can I talk to you about something in my\npersonal life?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 94250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91290, "text": "As long as it doesn't trigger a visual\nof you naked."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 98330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97330, "text": "Okay, here goes."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 102790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98710, "text": "For the past few months, there's been a\nvery special lady in my life. But we're"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 106610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102790, "text": "keeping it on the sly because she's\nrelated to someone we all know."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 110370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109370, "text": "What's so funny?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 114170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110490, "text": "Well, for some reason, when you said\nthat, I flashed on Bull's mother."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 118080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117040, "text": "walk -in tattoo parlor."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 123860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122180, "text": "It is Bull's mother."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 128300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126320, "text": "So, how'd you meet the little mermaid?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 131400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129880, "text": "It was at Bull's wedding reception."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 135160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131760, "text": "She was reaching for the oyster dip, and\nshe scooped up my heart."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 137720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136180, "text": "With her good hand or the hook?"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 140320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 139320, "text": "It was."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 142440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140800, "text": "Well, it was just so easy."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 145040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142780, "text": "So anyway, last night I called the ship\nto shore."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 148120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145480, "text": "and I asked her to be my bride, and she\nsaid,"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 150940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 149060, "text": "I are you, scurvy dog."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 156940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 153000, "text": "So what, besides the painfully obvious,\nis your problem?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 158860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157860, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 163680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 159380, "text": "Oh, you're wondering how to tell him\nthat his favorite handyman is also his"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 165320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163680, "text": "mother's favorite handyman."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 169600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 167660, "text": "Exactly. What if he gets peeved?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 173620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 170200, "text": "Well, Art, Bull loves his mother, and he\ndoesn't."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 175840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174840, "text": "Hate you."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 180620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176720, "text": "When he finds out how happy you are,\nhe's going to be thrilled."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 183480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 181320, "text": "I hope you're right because here he\ncomes."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 186440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184720, "text": "Hey, guys, what's up?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 189540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187080, "text": "Fool, I'm going to marry your mother."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 200260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194960, "text": "And what do I know? I'm no shrink."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 246140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244920, "text": "So, how's Bull doing?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 248180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246360, "text": "I just checked on him in the guard's\nlounge."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 252320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248560, "text": "He's sitting there with his vacant stare\nin his eyes drooling out of the side of"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 253320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252320, "text": "his mouth."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 254399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253420, "text": "Oh, good."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 255500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254400, "text": "He's back to normal."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 259019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258019, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 262240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259620, "text": "Don't worry. The villagers say he's\nafraid of fire."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 267560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265860, "text": "So, feeling better?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 276870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275010, "text": "Well, you mean you're not ticked off?"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 278170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277170, "text": "Heck no."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 282030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278270, "text": "After 40 years of sampling every fish in\nthe sea, Mama's finally dropped anchor."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 285730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282890, "text": "Way to go, Bull. I knew you'd take this\nlike a man."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 289990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286410, "text": "And just think of all the neat father\nand son things we can do. We can go to"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 293050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289990, "text": "circus, the zoo, ring doorbells and run."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 296270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294610, "text": "Yep, just like a man."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 300570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 297270, "text": "Come on, we got 40 years to catch up on,\nDad."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 308510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307150, "text": "Art's going to marry Bull's mother."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 321170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318530, "text": "File's up, sir, and my lunch can't be\ntoo far behind."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 326970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323130, "text": "I'm with you. Let's go from lovebirds to\njailbirds, huh, Matt? Call it. Yes,"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 328750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326970, "text": "sir. People versus Marie Antoinette."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 330690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329690, "text": "Solicitation."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 332990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331990, "text": "Prosecution."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 334390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333390, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 340940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 334940, "text": "Your Honor, Her Majesty the Queen of\nFrench Kissing was arrested on 42nd"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 346000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340940, "text": "when she offered two vice officers the\nchance to storm the Bastille."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 352380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349500, "text": "Maybe she should have just let them eat\ncake."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 357980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356000, "text": "So, uh, what happened, Marie?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 359240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358220, "text": "Lose your head?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 368620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365040, "text": "My client would like to throw herself on\nthe merci of the court."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 376740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371600, "text": "Come on, guys, don't you get it? It's\nFrench."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 380420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377480, "text": "Throw herself on the thank you of the\ncourt?"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 383760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381640, "text": "Oh, it's a pun."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 386060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384500, "text": "Honey, that's cheap."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 387840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386660, "text": "But then again..."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 400810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399810, "text": "Funny."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 403490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401370, "text": "And time to mange, mes amis."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 408890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404950, "text": "And I'm off to the Scholastic Salt\nMines. Well, Harry, why are you wasting"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 410410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408890, "text": "time with those pathetic pinheads?"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 413050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410710, "text": "It's not a waste, Dan. It's very\nstimulating."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 417590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413270, "text": "I had no idea I was going to enjoy\nteaching as much as I do, and I have a"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 421810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417590, "text": "feeling that Koch Community College is\ngoing to offer me a full professorship."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 425910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422450, "text": "So if you'll excuse me, I have a\ntutorial to conduct."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 428810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426470, "text": "Yeah, well, tell the pinheads I said\nduh."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 436420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435420, "text": "Professorship?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 441460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438420, "text": "Wait a minute. That would mean he would\nhave to give up his position here."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 444820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442740, "text": "Wow. Night court without Harry."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 447200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 445660, "text": "That's a pretty scary thought, huh?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 451740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450540, "text": "Not scary, Mac."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 454380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453380, "text": "Exhilarating."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 456860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454660, "text": "What are you talking about?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 460380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457460, "text": "I'm talking about Judge Daniel R."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 461760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460760, "text": "Fielding."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 470420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468040, "text": "to read the charge or the cell door\nopens and air it large."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 473700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470640, "text": "Five, six, seven, eight. What's that\nMiranda stipulate?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 478060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474100, "text": "Remain silent, get a lawyer, but spill\nyour guts and they'll destroy you."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 482180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478060, "text": "Sylvia, what's the key to the thing we\ncall double jeopardy? You can't try,"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 484380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482300, "text": "Vicki. Oh, shut your mouth, Sylvia."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 488300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486840, "text": "You got no rhythm."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 492120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490080, "text": "Pardon me for being passionate."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 495480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 492660, "text": "Well, by all means, get it out of your\nsystem before we get home."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 499800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498800, "text": "things up."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 504120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500140, "text": "I have no doubt that you kids are going\nto ace this test. Now get out of here."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 506540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504260, "text": "Get home. Get some rest. I'll see you\nall tomorrow."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 508280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507280, "text": "Travis."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 511360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510360, "text": "Sorry, teach."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 512940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511520, "text": "All habits die hard."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 518860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516740, "text": "Eat your heart out, Mr. Chips."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 523039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521400, "text": "If it isn't the diligent students."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 528120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523799, "text": "Hi. You know, I was just musing over how\nfortunate you are to have Judge Stone"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 529120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528120, "text": "for your instructor."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 531460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529220, "text": "Oh, he's truly a gift from God."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 533280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531840, "text": "Stop gushing, Sylvia."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 539060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534180, "text": "Well, Sylvia, if you feel so strongly,\nmaybe you should make your feelings"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 540160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 539060, "text": "to the dean."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 542160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540660, "text": "You mean like a brick through his\nwindow?"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 544820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543520, "text": "No, you student."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 549900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547440, "text": "I'm thinking more along the lines of a\nletter -writing campaign."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 551960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550400, "text": "Hey, we could tie a letter to a brick."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 553700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552700, "text": "I have."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 555910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553710, "text": "Of just such a letter. Here."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 557790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556270, "text": "All you have to do is sign your names."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 560350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558550, "text": "Hopefully there won't be too much of a\nchallenge."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 561850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560850, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 566050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561950, "text": "To whom it may concern, please give\nHarold T. Stone tenure."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 567790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566290, "text": "He makes loving fun."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 569090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568090, "text": "No, learning."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 573810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571890, "text": "I'm supposed to say learning. All right,\ngive me these."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 576430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574050, "text": "I'm going to correct them. I'll be right\nback. Wait here."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 578190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576770, "text": "Damn manual typewriters."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 584150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582650, "text": "Guess he forgot about us. Let's go."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 590990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589570, "text": "So, Art, how's it going?"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 592290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 591290, "text": "It's been better."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 598010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593290, "text": "Junior and me took in an all -night\nDaffy Duck marathon and capped it off"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 603450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598010, "text": "five hours of thumb wrestling followed\nby two hours of surgery."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 607830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605210, "text": "You let Bull perform surgery on you?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 611010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608450, "text": "Wow. You are a good daddy."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 617320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613340, "text": "Ladies, I'm in a quandary. As much as I\nlove Hank, I don't think I'm ready for"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 618320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617320, "text": "fatherhood."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 622280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618720, "text": "Well, it seems to me the problem is that\nBull's been acting like a son."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 625080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622800, "text": "So maybe you should try acting like a\nfather."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 626340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625340, "text": "You know, like... That's it."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 628160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627160, "text": "Reverse psychology."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 629980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628920, "text": "Junior wants a father?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 632120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630920, "text": "Junior's gonna get a father."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 634300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633180, "text": "Roz, you're brilliant."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 638260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637260, "text": "Reverse psychology."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 639720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638540, "text": "How'd you think of that one, Roz?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 642760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640100, "text": "I didn't. I was just gonna tell him to\nwhoop the kid."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 649780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644980, "text": "Uh -huh. Okay, so then the woman says,\nso, who's in charge of the food?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 652120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650800, "text": "Yeah, go on."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 655800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654760, "text": "It's a punchline."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 658680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657680, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 662080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660820, "text": "Not even a titter?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 664820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663540, "text": "I'm laughing on the inside."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 668720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666480, "text": "Well, maybe it was just a lousy joke."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 671960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669100, "text": "Yeah, it was pretty bad. I heard that\none before."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 673870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672650, "text": "I have it. How's it go?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 675310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674310, "text": "Um, let me see."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 680850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676090, "text": "Two women are walking down the street.\nOne says to the other, my husband is"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 681850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680850, "text": "having an affair."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 683770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681890, "text": "And the other one says, really?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 685130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684010, "text": "Who's catering?"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 694710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693110, "text": "Good day, good professor."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 699570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695370, "text": "I bring you this basket of cheer as a\nsmall token of my undying friendship and"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 700670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699570, "text": "unbounded respect."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 702780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701440, "text": "Get well soon, Grandma."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 705760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704760, "text": "She didn't."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 711340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708500, "text": "So, how did your charming students do on\ntheir final exam?"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 713340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712240, "text": "They all failed."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 719900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715040, "text": "I guess all I'm qualified for is passing\njudgment on scantily dressed women with"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 720900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719900, "text": "loose morals."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 725220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723880, "text": "God, I want that job."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 730940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729300, "text": "I got it. You can grade them on a curve."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 733260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732200, "text": "They all scored zero."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 735900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734420, "text": "You rate them on a bump."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 741800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738060, "text": "You know, what really puzzles me is that\nthey all had that material nailed for"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 742800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741800, "text": "the tutorial."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 744360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742900, "text": "Sounds like performance anxiety."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 749340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745000, "text": "Huh? You know, students can be totally\nprepared for a test, but when the clock"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 751040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749340, "text": "starts ticking, they freeze up."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 754180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753180, "text": "Performance anxiety?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 758500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755360, "text": "Well, if that's what it is, then all I\nwould have to do is retest them."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 760530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759530, "text": "You're brilliant."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 762170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760550, "text": "Oh, glad I could help."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 767370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763890, "text": "Hey, you guys. Did you hear the one\nabout the nearsighted Presbyterian and"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 768370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767370, "text": "billy goat?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 770350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769350, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 771829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770850, "text": "Do tell."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 772830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771830, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 774430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773150, "text": "So there's this Presbyterian."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 775709, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774770, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 776810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775710, "text": "Is he a Lutheran?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 781130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778410, "text": "Okay. There's this nearsighted Lutheran\nand the billy goat."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 782930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781930, "text": "Was it a sheep?"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 791770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790770, "text": "Everybody ready?"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 794270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791990, "text": "Oh, I hope so, sir. I was up all night."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 796910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795130, "text": "Walter, you pulled an all -nighter for\nthis test?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 799410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797350, "text": "Well, actually, I only studied until\nabout 8 .30."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 801850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799670, "text": "The rest of the time, I was hugging the\ntoilet."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 805530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803970, "text": "Walter, you need a woman."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 808510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806910, "text": "All right, what do you say we get\nstarted?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 810290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809290, "text": "Pass these back."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 814490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810650, "text": "And remember, if you have any questions\nat all, don't hesitate to ask."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 816630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814770, "text": "And we'll do our best to answer them."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 819210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817790, "text": "Dan, what are you doing here?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 822460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819470, "text": "Oh. I thought I'd just come by and lend\nsupport. I mean, after all, I helped you"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 824660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822460, "text": "make up the tasks. Why don't I stick\naround? I can help you grade them."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 828560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826780, "text": "Well, all right, but keep quiet."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 830780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828780, "text": "Shh, got you geniuses at work."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 835880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832880, "text": "All right, folks, you can start at your\nown pace."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 852400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851400, "text": "To see."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 856100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855100, "text": "To see."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 858680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857440, "text": "You say something, Dan."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 862420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859520, "text": "To see. I might go to see on vacation."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 865000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864000, "text": "Take a cruise."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 869440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866700, "text": "You keep quiet or you're going to cruise\nright out of here."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 870860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869760, "text": "Aye, aye, Skipper."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 872700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871520, "text": "Won't hear another peep out of me."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 891999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891280, "text": "Peep, Dan."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 894360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892000, "text": "Oh, I had a cramp in my finger."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 897000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895300, "text": "I've gotten about an inch of lead."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 899420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898420, "text": "Fielding, get up here."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 904280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901920, "text": "I want you to keep quiet. Make yourself\nuseful."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 934480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933480, "text": "That's better."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 936520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935520, "text": "Oh, sir."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 938100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936880, "text": "You missed a few."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 943260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941400, "text": "Those are the answers."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 946540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945540, "text": "Answers to what?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 951360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947980, "text": "The test. You idiot. Keep your voice\ndown."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 956420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953680, "text": "Why would the test answers be on the\nblackboard?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 964329, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963329, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 965870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964650, "text": "Those are the answers."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 969810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966710, "text": "Good Lord, Walter."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 972010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970670, "text": "Have you been cheating?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 976770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975690, "text": "I don't think so."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 981270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978810, "text": "All right, Dan. What the hell is going\non?"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 987790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984230, "text": "Oh, Harry, I'm sorry. I just wanted to\nhelp you achieve your dream."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 989570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988570, "text": "What dream?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 991430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990130, "text": "Of leaving the bench."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 993680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992050, "text": "What are you... talking about?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 995760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993940, "text": "Why would I want to quit my job?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 999200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996920, "text": "Because these pinheads need you, sir."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1003780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002740, "text": "Out. Right."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1009880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007000, "text": "All right, exam's over. Hand your papers\nup."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1014540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010400, "text": "Why is that, sir? Well, isn't it\nobvious? Dan gave you the answers."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1017780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014800, "text": "Now everyone will have the same answer\nfor number one, B."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1030810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025450, "text": "24 and a third? Now, how is this\npossible? You people know these answers,"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1033569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030810, "text": "even if you don't, they're right up in\nfront of you in black and white there."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1034690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033690, "text": "What's going on?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1038170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035609, "text": "Well, sir... Not a word, blondie."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1041910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1039710, "text": "I'm sorry, Travis. His will is too\nstrong."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1047410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043609, "text": "Sir, we conspired to fail the test so we\ncould take your class over again."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1050830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049090, "text": "Why in the world would you want to do\nthat?"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1055720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051160, "text": "Because we love this class. It's the\nmost important thing in our lives."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1058160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056240, "text": "It's the only thing in my life."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1062020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060580, "text": "I don't understand."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1065320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062520, "text": "Sir, you've inspired us."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1070180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066040, "text": "Thanks to you, I've decided to stop\ntrying to date lawyers and become one"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1071180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070180, "text": "myself."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1072760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071660, "text": "I've had that effect?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1074100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073100, "text": "You bet you have."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1076200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074900, "text": "You've been an inspiration."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1079000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076420, "text": "Your civil law lecture inspired me to\ntake action."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1080019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079260, "text": "You did?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1083430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080020, "text": "Yeah. I sued my neighbor and got that 90\n-year -old hag evicted."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1086530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085530, "text": "You did?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1087850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086850, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1090990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088270, "text": "Because of you, I have the courage to\nwear corduroy."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1096970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095970, "text": "Well, gosh."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1100270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1097270, "text": "And Morty and I have canceled our\ndivorce plans."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1102750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100830, "text": "But you two fight like pit bulls."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1105390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103570, "text": "Fine line between love and hate."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1108310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107010, "text": "You showed us the way."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1113169, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112490, "text": "I'm stunned."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1116550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113170, "text": "I mean, you got all that out of my\nlittle class."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1119770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118050, "text": "I really made that much of a difference?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1121030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120030, "text": "Yes. Absolutely."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1126390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121210, "text": "You know, for a while there, I was\nbeginning to think maybe Dan was right,"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1129130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126390, "text": "you were just a bunch of pinheads."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1132630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129890, "text": "Yes, sir, but we're your pinheads."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1136430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135370, "text": "You bet we are."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1141630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138050, "text": "I never thought I'd say this to a man,\nbut, uh..."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1149350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142570, "text": "I, uh... We, uh... I'm no good with the\nschmaltzy stuff."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1156410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150430, "text": "I think what Travis is trying to say,\nsir, is... How do you thank someone"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1158870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156410, "text": "taken you from crayons to perfume?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1163270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160510, "text": "It isn't easy, but we'll try."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1167590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164250, "text": "If you wanted the sky..."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1186040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185040, "text": "my pinheads."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1193760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192760, "text": "Hey, Dad."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1196180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194480, "text": "Ready for our camp out in Central Park?"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1199240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196920, "text": "I got the marshmallows and the mace."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1201460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199580, "text": "I have to wait."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1205260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201900, "text": "First, I need you to be a good son and\npaint Dad's apartment."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1209600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205800, "text": "Then you can steam clean Dad's carpeting\nand sandblast Dad's 75 Pinto."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1212200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211020, "text": "Then we can go camping."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1215640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212840, "text": "Not until you've finished all your\nbroccoli, Junior."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1223160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220480, "text": "You know, technically, you're not going\nto be my father."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1224880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223420, "text": "You're going to be my stepfather."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1228280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225360, "text": "And sons are supposed to resent their\nstepfathers."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1231800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230660, "text": "You're not my real father."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1233680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232420, "text": "You don't understand me."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1235720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234540, "text": "And don't call me Junior."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1246670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245390, "text": "Got any new jokes for us?"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1249550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247550, "text": "Know that I've given up trying to be\nfunny."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1253990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250210, "text": "Some people have it and some people\ndon't. From now on, I'm going to be"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1255090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253990, "text": "the profound candidate."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1257590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255950, "text": "The profound candidate?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1260150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258030, "text": "Yeah. Would you listen to the opening of\nmy Women's League speech?"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1267550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262190, "text": "My friends, the world is metamorphosing\nwith every turgid spin of its rhetorical"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1272650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267550, "text": "axis. As we careen through this\ntransitory flux, we're tempted to"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1274390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272890, "text": "you're arresting my destiny."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1281290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275530, "text": "but lest we forget life is like a window\nif you don't put up curtains the sun"}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1282570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281290, "text": "will fade the rug"}
